; A posting as written, sold from two lots at costs in two currencies. A budget's account holds two bars of gold: one
; at a cost in dollars, which the prices convert to the budget's yuan through the dollar, and one at a cost in pounds,
; which nothing converts. Buying the second is an amount no price converts. Giving both away is one posting, which
; booking splits into the two lots: it is checked whole, through the cost currency of its first lot, the dollar, so
; it converts and is no error; its activity is that of each lot, the dollar one converted, the pound one left out.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
option "timezone" "UTC"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 commodity USD
1970-01-01 commodity GBP
1970-01-01 commodity GOLD

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Gifts
2024-01-01 open Assets:Vault
  booking_method: "FIFO"
  budget: Gold

2024-01-01 budget Gold CNY
2024-01-01 budget-add Gold 5000 CNY

2024-01-01 price USD 7.10 CNY
2024-01-01 price GOLD 300 USD

2024-01-02 * "Dealer" "a bar at a cost in dollars"
  Assets:Vault 1 GOLD {300 USD}
  Assets:Bank -300 USD

2024-01-03 * "Dealer" "a bar at a cost in pounds, which nothing converts"
  Assets:Vault 1 GOLD {250 GBP}
  Assets:Bank -250 GBP

2024-02-01 * "Friend" "both bars given away in one posting, booked from the two lots"
  Assets:Vault -2 GOLD {}
  Expenses:Gifts 300 USD
  Expenses:Gifts 250 GBP
